This removes the use of utils-merge and replaces it with merge-descriptors. Merge descriptors is already used as a dependency in other files and performs the same task as utils-merge. Merge descriptors has an additional parameter to allow for adding a field if it doesn't exist on the target object. Merge descriptors method of creating fields also is more robust. This reduces the need for the utils-merge dependency.

